\p{JVM and native image give the same counts; so do the stepper and the tier with form T on reachability under the production policy (13 blocks, 1.53 M compiled activations per pass: ticks 9,094,072, records 4,818,323, run words 24,417,655 in both). With 4 workers the split of the units over the sessions moves the counts by up to 1\% from run to run; only the one-worker rows are exact.}

\p{\strong{Census of what block instructions build} (switch off, \code{\verb~|-Drlvm.t3.census=true~}; new record / existing record found, per pass):}

\table{
\tr{\th{corpus}\th{records per pass}\th{\code{\verb~|MKAPP~}}\th{\code{\verb~|MKLAM~} + \code{\verb~|MKPI~} + \code{\verb~|MKSUSP~}}\th{\code{\verb~|MKPROJ~}}\th{share of the records made by block instructions}\th{\code{\verb~|WHNF~} instructions: flag / memo / computed}}
\tr{\td{reachability}\td{4,819,810}\td{2,274,137 / 2,114,595}\td{706,202 / 922,985}\td{408,525 / 65,382}\td{70\%}\td{536,216 / 387,018 / 378,619}}
\tr{\td{Cedar slice}\td{5,031,495}\td{387,400 / 213,341}\td{293,107 / 709,494}\td{30,218 / 53,723}\td{14\%}\td{70,059 / 23,975 / 17,117}}
