}

\p{Reading: the applications that cost are not redexes handed to WHNF but ARGUMENTS and RESULTS (they are stored in other records and frames at once); half of reachability's \code{\verb~|MKAPP~} executions and most closure constructions find an existing record; on Cedar-level work six of seven records are made by the generic judgments, where no block instruction reaches. This is the table U2 needs (sent 19:32Z).}
}

