\li{\strong{\code{\verb~|t2 + call~} against \code{\verb~|t2~}}: 929 / 918, 512 / 513, 454 / 448, 402 / 409 on the JVM, 1239 / 1238 and 624 / 573 in the image: nothing at one worker; +9\% in the one eight-worker image cell (one process each).}
